<% layout("/layouts/boilerplate") %>

<div class="row mt-5">
  <div class="col-10 offset-1">
    <h1 class="mb-4">How to Host Responsibly</h1>
    
    <div class="card mb-4">
      <div class="card-body">
        <h5 class="card-title">🌱 Sustainable & Responsible Hosting</h5>
        <p class="card-text">
          As a host, you have the power to create positive impact on your community and environment. 
          Here's how to host responsibly.
        </p>
      </div>
    </div>
    
    <div class="row">
      <div class="col-md-6">
        <div class="card mb-4">
          <div class="card-body">
            <h5 class="card-title">🏘️ Community Impact</h5>
            <ul>
              <li><strong>Respect neighbors:</strong> Set quiet hours and noise guidelines</li>
              <li><strong>Support local businesses:</strong> Recommend nearby restaurants and shops</li>
              <li><strong>Cultural sensitivity:</strong> Share local customs and traditions</li>
              <li><strong>Parking considerations:</strong> Provide clear parking instructions</li>
              <li><strong>Waste management:</strong> Follow local recycling guidelines</li>
            </ul>
          </div>
        </div>
        
        <div class="card mb-4">
          <div class="card-body">
            <h5 class="card-title">🌍 Environmental Responsibility</h5>
            <ul>
              <li><strong>Energy efficiency:</strong> Use LED bulbs and energy-saving appliances</li>
              <li><strong>Water conservation:</strong> Install low-flow fixtures</li>
              <li><strong>Eco-friendly products:</strong> Use biodegradable cleaning supplies</li>
              <li><strong>Waste reduction:</strong> Provide recycling bins and composting</li>
              <li><strong>Sustainable amenities:</strong> Offer reusable water bottles</li>
            </ul>
          </div>
        </div>
      </div>
      
      <div class="col-md-6">
        <div class="card mb-4">
          <div class="card-body">
            <h5 class="card-title">👥 Guest Safety & Wellbeing</h5>
            <ul>
              <li><strong>Safety equipment:</strong> Smoke detectors, fire extinguishers</li>
              <li><strong>First aid kit:</strong> Basic medical supplies available</li>
              <li><strong>Emergency contacts:</strong> Local emergency numbers posted</li>
              <li><strong>Secure access:</strong> Safe key exchange and entry systems</li>
              <li><strong>Health protocols:</strong> Regular cleaning and sanitization</li>
            </ul>
          </div>
        </div>
        
        <div class="card mb-4">
          <div class="card-body">
            <h5 class="card-title">📋 Legal Compliance</h5>
            <ul>
              <li><strong>Local regulations:</strong> Follow city hosting laws</li>
              <li><strong>Tax obligations:</strong> Report income and pay taxes</li>
              <li><strong>Insurance coverage:</strong> Maintain adequate property insurance</li>
              <li><strong>Guest registration:</strong> Comply with local registration requirements</li>
              <li><strong>Safety standards:</strong> Meet building and fire safety codes</li>
            </ul>
          </div>
        </div>
      </div>
    </div>
    
    <div class="card">
      <div class="card-body">
        <h5 class="card-title">🏆 Responsible Host Checklist</h5>
        <div class="row">
          <div class="col-md-6">
            <div class="form-check">
              <input class="form-check-input" type="checkbox" id="check1">
              <label class="form-check-label" for="check1">
                Installed smoke and carbon monoxide detectors
              </label>
            </div>
            <div class="form-check">
              <input class="form-check-input" type="checkbox" id="check2">
              <label class="form-check-label" for="check2">
                Provided emergency contact information
              </label>
            </div>
            <div class="form-check">
              <input class="form-check-input" type="checkbox" id="check3">
              <label class="form-check-label" for="check3">
                Set clear house rules for noise and parties
              </label>
            </div>
            <div class="form-check">
              <input class="form-check-input" type="checkbox" id="check4">
              <label class="form-check-label" for="check4">
                Use eco-friendly cleaning products
              </label>
            </div>
          </div>
          <div class="col-md-6">
            <div class="form-check">
              <input class="form-check-input" type="checkbox" id="check5">
              <label class="form-check-label" for="check5">
                Registered with local authorities if required
              </label>
            </div>
            <div class="form-check">
              <input class="form-check-input" type="checkbox" id="check6">
              <label class="form-check-label" for="check6">
                Provided local business recommendations
              </label>
            </div>
            <div class="form-check">
              <input class="form-check-input" type="checkbox" id="check7">
              <label class="form-check-label" for="check7">
                Maintained adequate insurance coverage
              </label>
            </div>
            <div class="form-check">
              <input class="form-check-input" type="checkbox" id="check8">
              <label class="form-check-label" for="check8">
                Implemented water and energy saving measures
              </label>
            </div>
          </div>
        </div>
      </div>
    </div>
  </div>
</div>